00:11:44,659 --> 00:11:48,018
well enough; and what does it matter to me whether you’re a little girl or a

147
00:11:48,019 --> 00:11:53,238
serpent?” “It matters a good deal to me said Alice hastily; “but I’m not looking

148
00:11:53,239 --> 00:11:56,598
for eggs, as it happens; and if I was, I

