an open place, with a little house in it about four feet high.

164
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:19,698
“Whoever lives there,” thought Alice, “it’ll never do to come upon them this size:

165
00:13:19,699 --> 00:13:24,259
why, I should frighten them out of their wits!” So she began nibbling at the

166
